    </head>
    <body>
        <main>
            <header class="issuer">
                <h1><?= $escape($document['issuer']['name'] ?: 'Institution not configured') ?></h1>
                <p class="address"><?= $escape($document['issuer']['address']) ?></p>
                <h2><?= $document['preview'] ? 'Academic transcript preview — not issued' : 'Official academic transcript' ?></h2>
            </header>
            <dl>
                <dt>Student</dt>
                <dd><?= $escape($document['student']['name']) ?></dd>
                <dt>Institutional ID</dt>
                <dd><?= $escape($document['student']['institutional_id']) ?></dd>
                <dt>Primary program at preparation</dt>
                <dd><?= $escape($document['program']['code']) ?> — <?= $escape($document['program']['title']) ?></dd>
                <dt>Catalog year</dt>
                <dd><?= $escape($document['catalog']['year_code'] ?? 'Catalog needs review') ?></dd>
            </dl>
            <div class="scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Academic credit history">
                <table>
                    <caption>Academic credit history; dropped enrollments are omitted</caption>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="col">Term</th>
                            <th scope="col">Course</th>
                            <th scope="col">Title</th>
                            <th scope="col">Type</th>
                            <th scope="col">Attempted</th>
                            <th scope="col">Earned</th>
                            <th scope="col">Grade</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <?php foreach ($document['credits'] as $row) : ?>
                        <tr>
                            <td><?= $escape($row['term_code']) ?></td>
                            <td><?= $escape($row['course_code']) ?></td>
                            <td><?= $escape($row['course_title']) ?></td>
                            <td><?= $escape($row['credit_type']) ?></td>
                            <td><?= $credits($row['attempted_milli']) ?></td>
                            <td><?= $credits($row['completed_milli']) ?></td>
                            <td><?= $escape($row['grade_code'] ?? 'In progress') ?></td>
                        </tr>
                        <?php endforeach; ?>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <dl>
                <dt>Total attempted credits</dt>
                <dd><?= $credits($document['totals']['attempted_milli']) ?></dd>
                <dt>Total earned credits</dt>
                <dd><?= $credits($document['totals']['completed_milli']) ?></dd>
                <dt>Cumulative GPA</dt>
                <dd><?= $document['totals']['gpa_milli'] === null ? 'Not yet available' : $credits($document['totals']['gpa_milli']) ?></dd>
            </dl>
            <p>Grades and credit values reflect the academic record at preparation. In-progress courses have no final grade. GPA includes only posted grades configured to count toward GPA; values are displayed to three decimal places.</p>
            <footer>
                <p>Document reference: <?= $escape($document['document_id'] ?? 'Preview only') ?>.</p>
                <p>Prepared at: <?= $escape($document['issued_at'] ?? 'Not issued') ?>. Recipient delivery is tracked separately; a download alone does not establish delivery.</p>
            </footer>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>
